From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] shell32: IFileOperation copy, delete, rename and new-item operations (3599)

shell32: IFileOperation copy, delete, rename and new-item operations

CopyItem, CopyItems, MoveItems, DeleteItem, DeleteItems, RenameItem,
RenameItems and NewItem queue operations that PerformOperations runs with
the progress-sink notifications (Pre/Post Copy, Delete, Rename, NewItem).
Deleting honours FOF_ALLOWUNDO (recycle bin). SetOwnerWindow,
SetProgressMessage and SetProgressDialog keep what they are given.
Items arrays may be IShellItemArray or IDataObject.
